---
import { Users2, Award, Shield, Mail, ArrowUpRight, GraduationCap } from 'lucide-react';
import GitHubIcon from './GitHubIcon.astro';
---

<section id="governance" class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-200">
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
    <span className="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-blue-900 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
      Institutional Organization
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-3 mb-4">
      Governance & Leadership Structure
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Structured according to official university student society guidelines, integrating academic faculty oversight with energetic student leadership.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start mb-14">
    <!-- Left Column: Faculty Advisory Council -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-800">
          <GraduationCap class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Faculty Advisory Council</h3>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">Academic Patronage & Oversight</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        The society operates with institutional patronage from university academic leadership to ensure cross-faculty alignment, ethical standards, and lab venue access.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-blue-900 font-bold block mb-1">
            Faculty Advisor — Computing & IT
          </span>
          <p class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Department of Computer Science</p>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Curriculum validation, computing lab accreditation & technical integrity.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-amber-900 font-bold block mb-1">
            Faculty Advisor — Management Sciences
          </span>
          <p class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Department of Business Administration</p>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Business model governance, venture evaluation & incubation ethics.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-emerald-900 font-bold block mb-1">
            Institutional Liaison
          </span>
          <p class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Office of Student Affairs & Registrar</p>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Event permissions, campus auditorium clearance & society registry.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Student Executive Council -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-900">
            <Users2 class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Student Executive Council</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">Founding Cabinet (2026–2027)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-semibold">
          Active Cabinet
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Lead Profile Card -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 to-blue-950 text-white mb-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-amber-400 text-lg">
              AI
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-white">Ashar Iftikhar</h4>
              <span class="text-xs text-amber-300 font-mono">Founder & Society Lead</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <a
              href="https://github.com/ashariftikhar"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white transition-colors"
              title="GitHub Profile"
            >
              <GitHubIcon class="w-4 h-4" />
            </a>
            <a
              href="mailto:ashiriftikharofficial@gmail.com"
              class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white transition-colors"
              title="Email Lead"
            >
              <Mail class="w-4 h-4" />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Full-Stack Web Developer & AI Systems Architect. Founder of Ashflow. Establishing the official UOS student developer and venture ecosystem and spearheading the university's first GitHub Campus Expert accreditation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Executive Cabinet Recruitment Slots -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 block">
          Cabinet Portfolios (Spring 2027 Recruitment):
        </span>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block mb-0.5">Vice President (Operations)</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed block">Manages logistics, campus hall clearance, and executive coordination.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block mb-0.5">Director of Technical Programs</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed block">Oversees GitHub repositories, computing lab sessions, and code reviews.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block mb-0.5">Director of Incubation & Strategy</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed block">Coordinates business plan evaluation, pitch nights, and founder mentoring.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block mb-0.5">Director of Communications</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed block">Directs campus awareness, workshop design posters, and social media.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
